{"id":"wb-6-889","name":"盐业银行旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"盐业银行旧址 (天津)","text":"盐业银行旧址，建于1928年，当时为盐业银行的总部大楼，坐落于当时天津法租界的水师营路（Rue de L'Amiraute）（今和平区赤峰道12号），该建筑目前为中国工商银行天津分行营业部。目前，盐业银行旧址被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，被天津市人民政府批准为特殊保护等级历史风貌建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_(%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5)","revisionId":92093780,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92093780","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d80d8e4e45475d3cd318cb3c.jpg","title":"20150131-_盐业银行旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20150131-_%E7%9B%90%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/20150131-_%E7%9B%90%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Rudwig","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： 6-889","width":320,"height":213}}